  "title": "Microwave Macaroni and Cheese",
  "description": "Learn how to cook macaroni in the microwave with this nice alternative to baked macaroni and cheese. Use your microwave for cooking onions and butter before tossing them with cooked pasta, milk, and processed cheese cubes. One more stint in the microwave will melt the cheese.",
  "authors": [
